{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Kk4u2zALzeAysypfGgZVXA","type":"tool_result","content":"28:### Test plan\n29-\n30-Run `go test ./internal/config/... ./internal/gitx/... ./internal/committer/... ./internal/closeout/... ./internal/worker/... ./internal/configcmd/...`, then `make test`.\n31-\n32-- `internal/config/load_test.go`: `TestLoadWhenKeepsDirSlash` (`when: {paths: [web/, \"**/*.lock\"]}` gives `[\"web/\", \"**/*.lock\"]`); `TestLoadWhenInvalidGlob` rejected with the `when.paths[i]` key; `TestLoadWhenEmptyRejected` (`when: {}` and `when: {paths: []}` fail; `when: null` loads as nil).\n33-- `internal/config` new `when_test.go`, table for `Matches`: nil true; `web/` vs `web/a/b.tsx` true, `web` true, `webapp/x` false; `**/go.mod` vs `go.mod` true, `a/b/go.mod` true, `Go.mod` false; `package*.json` vs `package.json` true, `sub/package.json` false; `go.mod` exact glob (rename of old `TestWhenPathsDirPrefix`); `**/*.lock`; triage ran true/false; paths OR triage; empty changed with paths-only rule false; #44's exact starter list as a row.\n34-- `internal/config` `TestSelectReviewers`: no `when` selects all; path hit/miss; triage hit; worker list narrows and still honours `when:`; order is config order; unknown names ignored.\n35-- `internal/gitx` `TestChangedPathsRenames` (rename lists both paths; deletion listed).\n36-- `internal/closeout` `TestTriageRolesOnlyClosedDone` (closed done counted; failed, open, needs-human ignored; duplicates collapsed).\n37-- `internal/worker/loop_test.go` (extend `TestReviewersUnsetMeansAll`): when-gated reviewer skipped and included; triage via state only and via label only; needs-human triage does not count; worker list does not bypass `when:`; lead-deferred and role-file `next` bypass `when:` (no duplicates); new branch with no `refs/ard/` ref works; dry-run zero SHA fails open without warning; git error fails open with one `worker.reviewers_failed` (`step`); store error falls back to labels